      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The present Cr.M.P. has been filed with the following prayer:-\n\"It is, therefore prayed that the Hon'ble Court be pleased to:-\n1. allow this petition,\n2. call for the entire records from the learned Court of JMFC, Rajpur in Misc. Cr.\nCase No. 313/2023,\n3. quash / set aside the charge sheet filed before the learned Judicial Magistrate First Class, Rajpur, District Balrampur - Ramanujganj (C.G.) & pending vide Misc. Cr.\nCase No. 313/2023 State of Chhattisgarh Vs Laxman Kujur and also First Information report registered vide Crime No. 66/2023, in Police Station Rajpur, for the offence punishable U/s. 376 (2)(N) of IPC and the petitioner be discharged from all the charges, in the interest of justice.",
